      "text": "Clarify the controlling 2026–2027 thesis-entry requirement for the Dutch Bedrijfskunde programme MAN-BPRO372A. The latest September OER Appendix 4 p35 requires at least102 EC including Academic Skills and Onderzoeks- en Interventiemethodologie A and B, which are absent under those names from the renewed Appendix3 curriculum. The current official2026 Osiris course172589 instead requires102 EC including BIN117B, BPRA171 and BPRO100A. An authoritative amendment, explicit equivalence/transition rule or precedence statement is needed to reconcile these current official conditions. No exemption, replacement equivalence or administrative error is assumed."
